  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "横版动作融合roguelike、银河城与刷宝，玩家作为命运之子修复破碎世界并追查真相。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "\"7th Domain\" is a horizontal version action game derived from Roguelike Metroidvania combined with treasure grinding gameplay. You will play a child of destiny who repairs the world and finds the truth of the broken world.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3088410/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "武器与技能可自由组合，每套搭配都会带来不同战术与战斗体验。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "This world provides a variety of combinations of weapons and skills, each of which can bring different strategies and combat experiences.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3088410/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "大量装备词缀可拼装成不同属性战术，支撑剑与魔法风格的刷装路线。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "This world provides a wide variety of equipment affixes, which can be assembled into various attribute tactics. Use such a mechanism to pay tribute to the pursuit of the sword and magic era.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3088410/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
